<p><strong>Lift 29.5 vs. Lift X 29.5:</strong> the Lift X replaced the Lift 29.5 in the 2025 lineup. Because the Lift is now the previous model, you can sometimes find it at a better value from dealers clearing stock or on the used market. Check current price before deciding, since the gap moves through the year.</p>
